<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain's Q3 M3 falls 1.1 pct qtr/qtr.</title>
<headline>Bahrain's Q3 M3 falls 1.1 pct qtr/qtr.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahrain's broadly defined M3 money supply fell 1.1 percent in the third quarter of 1996 on the previous quarter, Bahrain Monetary Agency figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed data (percentage changes over three months)</p>
<p>		Q3 1996	Q2 1996	Q1 1996	Q4 1995</p>
<p> M3	    -1.1	   +1.0	   -2.8	   +7.2</p>
<p> M2	    -0.3	   +1.1	   -0.2	   +1.8</p>
<p>Monetary aggregates (in millions of dinars)</p>
<p>		Q3 1996	Q2 1996	Q1 1996	Q4 1995</p>
<p> M3	   1,806.1	1,826.3	1,808.0	1,859.7</p>
<p> M2	   1,406.8	1,411.2	1,395.3	1,397.5</p>
<p>NOTE: No figures were given for M1.</p>
</text>
